{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1357262-veneru-a-white-elephant-for-kalzky","id":1357262,"title":"Veneru: A White Elephant for Kalzky","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-12-27T15:59:38-08:00","id":1357262,"title":"Veneru: A White Elephant for Kalzky","content":"Once, Veneru was one of innumerable gods of the hunt, little known and less worshipped. To remove himself from the pack, and claim his own notoriety, he decided he needed to find a niche. He chose to be the god of what comes after the hunt - meat, especially its cooking and preparation, goods crafted from bone and leather, and the celebration of success. No longer a rival of the hordes of hunt gods, now he is ally. He bargains with his former peers to combine the cults, receiving a part of the prayer at the end of a hunt in exchange for his help in spreading the joint cult. In each of these deals, he is worshipped as a junior god, but he is worshipped as such by many cults.<br /> <br /> <b>Veneru</b> <br /> <b>Essence: </b>3; <b>Willpower: </b>7; <b>Join Battle: </b>9 dice <b>Personal Motes: </b>80 <b>Health Levels: </b>-0x2/-1x4/-2x2/-4/Incap.<br /> <b>Actions: </b>Crafting (Cooking, Leatherworking, Bonecarving, Artifacts, etc) 12 dice, Tracking 10 dice, Senses 8 dice, Stealth 8 dice, Resist Poison/Disease 6 dice, Evaluating Food 10 dice, Social Influence 7 dice<br /> Appearance 2, Resolve 3, Guile 3<br /> <b>Combat </b><br /> Attack (Kipu\u2019s Tooth): 12 dice (16/4 damage)<br /> Combat Movement: 9 dice<br /> Evasion 4, Parry 6<br /> Soak/Hardness 9/2 (When wearing mortal light armor)<br /> <br /> Merits<br /> Cult 3: Veneru is generally worshipped at the end of the hunt, when thanks is given for a success, and his worshippers ask for his blessing in cooking the meat, and crafting the rest of the body into useful goods.<br /> <br /> <i>Offensive Charms</i><br /> <b>Deadly Fang Charge </b>(5m; Supplemental; Instant; Uniform; Essence 1): This supplements an attack made by someone Veneru moved at least a range band towards since the end of his last turn (including on this turn). It adds 3 dice to the attack and damage roll. On withering attacks, this is post-soak.<br /> <b>Prey-Marking Assault </b>(3m, 1wp; Supplemental; Instant; Decisive-Only; Essence 2): This supplements a decisive attack. If it deals damage, it imposes a -3 penalty on all actions that aren\u2019t fleeing from Veneru. At the end of each of their turns, if they are within close range of Veneru, they take 1 die of hardness-ignoring lethal damage. This lasts until the end of the scene. Multiple uses on the same target don\u2019t stack, but multiple enemies can be crippled at the same time.<br /> <br /> <i>Miscellaneous Charms</i><br /> <b>Forming the Hunt\u2019s Reward</b>(5m, 1wp; Supplemental; Instant; Essence 3): On a roll to craft something, Veneru doubles 9s and rerolls 1s until no 1s appear. If the object is entirely or primarily made of a being Veneru has hunted and killed, add a number of dice equal to the victim\u2019s essence<br /> <b>Pack-Binding Revelry</b>(10m, 1wp; Simple; Instant; Essence 1): Use when serving a meal made from the results of a group hunt to everyone who participated in the hunt (the meal may be also served to extra people, as long as everyone who was hunting eats at least some of the meal. However, only those who participated in the hunt are affected by the charm). The roll to cook the food also counts as a roll to instill a tie of camaraderie towards the hunting group. Everyone who doesn\u2019t apply their resolve gains a pool of 5 dice, may be spent on any rolls involved in the next hunt this group conducts. This charm can be used a distance, should the subjects engage in a successful prayer to Veneru.<br /> <b>Glory-Acknowledging Feast</b>(1wp; Simple; One Month; Essence 3): Use when eating something Veneru has killed, or on behalf of someone he observes eating something they killed. The subject gains some capability of the victim \u2013 a merit, a special attack, a charm, or similar. This capability should be chosen by the Storyteller, and if a charm the subject must meet any prerequisites it has. This charm can be used a distance, should the subject engage in a successful prayer to Veneru.<br /> <b>Eager Hunter\u2019s Pursuit</b>(20m, 1wp; Supplemental; Indefinite; Essence 3): This aids an effort to track someone. Double 9s on the tracking roll. If he successfully tracks them, he is able to keep pace with them - regardless of how fast his quarry travels, he never falls much further behind than when he started. When he catches them, he doubles 9s on any senses rolls to spot them, stealth rolls to sneak up on them, and his join battle roll.<br /> <b>Travelling on Your Stomach Approach</b>(10m; Simple; Instant; Essence 3): This creates a roll to forage for food, except it generates enough food to feed an additional person for every extra success. Additionally, this foraging can be done while performing other activities without penalty, allowing Veneru to travel as fast as he could if he were otherwise supplied.<br /> <b>Hurry Home</b>(10m, 1wp; Simple; Instant; Essence 1): Veneru fades away and vanishes on his next turn, drawn instantly back to his sanctum. <br /> <b>Materialize</b>(40, 1wp; Simple; Instant; Essence 1): Veneru steps out as if from nothing, accompanied by the smell of roasting meat. <br /> <b>Measure the Wind</b>(5m; Simple; Instant; Essence 1): Veneru can take the measure of anyone who hunts alongside him, or who eats a meal he cooked.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23597-autxauty","name":"autXautY","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}